<PolicyLayout title="QuickBooks integration" description="tjm.art’s private QuickBooks Online integration for recording Vermillion Aurora sales." noindex>
<p>tjm.art uses a private integration with Intuit QuickBooks Online to record Vermillion Aurora sales in TJ Murphy’s QuickBooks Online company for bookkeeping. It is used by the site owner only. It is not offered to other businesses, and customers do not need to sign in to QuickBooks.</p>
<p>When an order is completed on this site, the order details (items, amounts, tax, shipping, and the buyer’s name and email) are recorded in the owner’s QuickBooks Online accounting. See the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a> and <a href="/terms/">Terms of use</a>.</p>
<p>Questions or support: <a href="mailto:tj@vermillionaurora.com?subject=QuickBooks%20integration">tj@vermillionaurora.com</a>.</p>
<p class="quickbooks-owner"><a class="button button-solid" href="/quickbooks/connect" rel="nofollow">Connect to QuickBooks</a> <span>(site owner only; requires the manager token)</span></p>
</PolicyLayout>
